T*
(#1\) Product Summary) Tj
T*
(Build a fast, conversion-focused insurance quote marketplace MVP that captures inbound consumer) Tj
T*
(quote requests, routes leads to internal agents based on rules, and tracks funnel + SLA) Tj
T*
(performance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#2\) Goals) Tj
T*
(- Launch in 30 days with FL-first scope.) Tj
T*
(- Minimize quote-request friction.) Tj
T*
(- Route leads automatically with clear ownership.) Tj
T*
(- Measure speed-to-contact and conversion performance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#3\) Non-Goals \(MVP\)) Tj
T*
(- Full national rollout.) Tj
T*
(- Deep carrier API quoting integrations.) Tj
T*
(- Advanced pricing engine.) Tj
T*
(- Complex call-center tooling.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#4\) MVP Scope) Tj
T*
(- Product lines: Auto + Home \(initial\)) Tj
T*
(- Geography: FL \(expandable\)) Tj
T*
