T*
(  - Homepage) Tj
T*
(  - Auto page) Tj
T*
(  - Home page) Tj
T*
(  - Multi-step quote form) Tj
T*
(  - Thank-you page) Tj
T*
(- Internal pages:) Tj
T*
(  - Login) Tj
T*
(  - Lead dashboard) Tj
T*
(  - Routing rules manager) Tj
T*
(  - SLA alerts view) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#5\) Users & Roles) Tj
T*
(- Consumer: submits quote request.) Tj
T*
(- Producer: receives/works assigned leads.) Tj
T*
(- CSR: supports service/follow-up.) Tj
T*
(- Admin/Ops: manages rules, users, monitoring.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#6\) User Stories) Tj
T*
(1. As a consumer, I can submit quote details in under 3 minutes.) Tj
T*
(2. As Ops, I can auto-route leads by state/product.) Tj
T*
(3. As a producer, I can see new leads and contact status.) Tj
T*
(4. As admin, I can detect untouched leads beyond SLA.) Tj
